{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/ec0490b70c6eb29afdaffb7721516fe4.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partake in epic battles with giant creatures as you attempt to defy the impossible against bosses of all different types, sizes and abilities. Can you make it through?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.poster.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.webm?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/eeaf846260f0bd91ffa1019d935a983e.mp4?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/1388ee649c1fb39115d27a1e23e7a1b6.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through this journey of self discovery as you slowly unlock different memories in an attempt to unveil more about this mysterious world and your place in it<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/259086d2ca1d38089bda9bc2a8bc1d1f.poster.avif?t=1752053659\" width=760 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/259086d2ca1d38089bda9bc2a8bc1d1f.webm?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/259086d2ca1d38089bda9bc2a8bc1d1f.mp4?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/210c089269afb8bbce44702d79425767.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=150 /></span>Explore a world of secrets and ancient wonders as you unravel the truth about your estranged father in a personal, intimate story written by an indie developer <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.poster.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.webm?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/599b89b41d2596d9c1c4897f1d5e42a9.mp4?t=1752053659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/a8e060ceafa7fdb1915837b23926c48f.avif?t=1752053659\" width=800 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I am Jugraaj - an independent developer that occasionally works with contractors on a ramp on/ramp off basis depending on production.<br>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&gt;Don't forget to wishlist Norigin if you are interested in the game</i><br><i>&gt;Join the discord to become part of our community!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/56c5d1e83e8fa689d8c3f30a1fb0b40